    <string name="settings_clear_data">Clear app data</string>
    <string name="settings_clear_data_desc">Deletes all calls, contacts copies and settings stored by this app.</string>
    <string name="settings_reset_note">This does not delete your phone or WhatsApp call history. It only clears this app\'s local database.</string>
    <string name="settings_reset_warning">Calls older than what your phone\'s call log still keeps cannot be imported again.</string>
    <string name="settings_confirm">Delete</string>
    <string name="settings_section_about">About</string>
    <string name="settings_about_sources">About data sources</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_sources_body">• Phone calls come from Android\'s system call log (CallLog).\n\n• WhatsApp calls are imported only when Android itself lists them in the call log and identifies WhatsApp as the calling app. This depends on your Android version (16.1+), your dialer and WhatsApp.\n\n• This app never reads WhatsApp\'s private database or files.\n\n• Optional notification detection can record some future WhatsApp calls. It cannot recover past calls, and its duration and direction are approximate.\n\n• Calls from other VoIP apps are shown with an unknown source rather than guessed.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Call history and contact names are stored only in this app\'s private database on this device.\n\nThe app has no internet permission, no account, no analytics, no crash reporting and no backup to the cloud. Nothing is uploaded or shared.\n\nUninstalling the app or using \"Clear app data\" removes everything it stored.</string>
